        <body>
            <div xml:id="d459">

                <pb facs="0717" n="603" xml:id="pg603"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760C.6215/556</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Press Release Issued by the White House, October 25,
                        1931</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1931-10-25">October 25, 1931</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>The following statement was issued by the White House: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>A press statement that the President has proposed any revision of the
                            Polish Corridor is absolutely without foundation. The President has made
                            no suggestions of any such character.</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
